    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d461">

                <pb facs="0575" n="467" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg467"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Señor
                            Romero.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-10-17"><hi rendition="#italic">October 17,
                        1893</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 13th instant further relating to the pursuit of marauders on
                    June 30 last by Texas Rangers across the boundary line into Mexico, and to say
                    that I have made known its contents to the governor of Texas. Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
